{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36832","headline":"寄酬邺王罗令公五首 五 · 罗隐","name":"寄酬邺王罗令公五首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"锦笈朱囊连复连，紫鸾飞下浙江边。\n绡从海室夺烟雾，乐奏帝官胜管弦。\n长笑应刘悲显达，每嫌伊霍少诗篇。\n戴湾老圃根基薄，虚费工夫八十年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36832.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36832","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}